# Snapshot: code/int_bool_type_errors

## Case 01

### Source: `test/tmp_fs/code.frog`

```frog
proc main -- do
    true 5 + print
end
```

### Run

Command:

```text
python -m frog run test/tmp_fs/code.frog
```

Output:

